    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19970" root="سفع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفْعٌ مِنَ النَّارِ</span></b>  <i>A mark, from fire, altering the
colour of a man.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفْعٌ</span> also signifies <i>A
garment of any kind:</i> (K:) but mostly <i>such as is
dyed:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُفُوعٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And hence, perhaps,]
The <i>spathe,</i> or <i>spadix,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلْع</span>,) <i>of a tree called</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِمْخٌ</span>. (AA, T in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظمخ</span>.)

